# Full-text search

`pebbles list --grep <query>` searches issue titles AND descriptions with a
small query syntax: space-separated terms are ANDed (each matches as a
case-insensitive substring), double-quoted phrases match verbatim (internal
spacing and word order preserved), and results keep the list's
updated_at-descending order (--grep adds no ranking, unlike --search, which
sorts by fuzzy-match quality). It composes with --status, --issue-type,
--search, --tag, and --metadata.

Fixture store: 111 (Login button doesn't respond on mobile, todo bug,
description "The login button doesn't respond to clicks on mobile devices",
tag mobile, metadata priority=high), 222 (JWT token authentication system,
todo design, description "Design and implement JWT-based authentication"),
333 (User can login with email and password, in progress usecase), 444
(Export users to CSV, done usecase).

## Baseline list (updated_at descending)

```console
$ pebbles list
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV

```

## Title substring match

```console
$ pebbles list --grep jwt
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓

```

## Description-only match

The word "clicks" appears only in 111's description, not in any title.

```console
$ pebbles list --grep clicks
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Case-insensitive matching

```console
$ pebbles list --grep CSV
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV

```
```console
$ pebbles list --grep Mobile
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Space-separated terms are ANDed

Both given terms must match: "login" matches 111 and 333, "mobile" matches
111 only, so only 111 survives. The query is one quoted argument; each
space-separated word becomes a separate term.

```console
$ pebbles list --grep "login mobile"
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```
```console
$ pebbles list --grep "jwt auth"
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓

```

## Quoted phrases match verbatim

A phrase is a single substring: "jwt based" is not a substring of
"JWT-based" (the hyphen), while the ANDed terms "jwt" and "based" both match
222's description. A phrase's internal spacing is part of the match:
"login  button" (two spaces) is not a substring of 111's title.

```console
$ pebbles list --grep '"jwt based"'
No issues found.

```
```console
$ pebbles list --grep "jwt based"
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓

```
```console
$ pebbles list --grep '"login  button"'
No issues found.

```
```console
$ pebbles list --grep "login button"
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Matches keep the updated_at-descending order

```console
$ pebbles list --grep login
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓

```

## Search composes with --status

```console
$ pebbles list --grep login --status todo
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Search composes with --issue-type

```console
$ pebbles list --grep auth --issue-type design
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓

```

## Search composes with --search

```console
$ pebbles list --search login
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓

```
```console
$ pebbles list --search login --grep mobile
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Search composes with --tag

```console
$ pebbles list --grep login --tag mobile
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Search composes with --metadata

```console
$ pebbles list --grep login --metadata priority=high
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Search composes with several filters at once

```console
$ pebbles list --grep login --status todo --issue-type bug --tag mobile --metadata priority=high
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## No match

```console
$ pebbles list --grep zzzz
No issues found.

```

## Blank query matches nothing

An explicitly blank --grep is a distinct filter, not the unfiltered list.

```console
$ pebbles list --grep ""
No issues found.

```

## Unterminated quote is an error

```console
$ pebbles list --grep \"login
? failed
Error: Unterminated quote in --grep query: missing closing "

```

## Empty phrase is an error

An empty phrase would match every issue, so it is rejected rather than
silently meaning "all".

```console
$ pebbles list --grep '""'
? failed
Error: Empty phrase in --grep query: "" is not a selector

```
